{"sourceUrl":"https://cee.nankai.edu.cn/2026/0908/c37052a602087/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:05.177127+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://cee.nankai.edu.cn/2026/0908/c37052a602087/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><p><span><span><strong><span>南开大学</span></strong></span></span><strong><span>2027</span></strong><span><span><strong><span>年工程硕博士培养改革专项（全日制）接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生（含直博）若干方向开放预报名</span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>卓越工程师学院接收工程硕博士培养改革专项（全日制）优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生（含直博）预报名有若干方向开放报名（报名时间截至</span></span><span>9</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>9</span><span><span>日下午</span></span><span>16:00</span><span><span>）。</span></span></p><p><br/><br/></p><p><span><span><strong><span>一、申请条件</span></strong></span></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span><span>中华人民共和国公民，热爱祖国，遵纪守法，品德良好，身心健康；</span></span></p><p><span>2.</span><span><span>本科学习成绩优秀，在目前就读学校能取得教育部推荐免试研究生资格并有意到我院深造的国内高校</span></span><span>2027</span><span><span>届本科毕业生；</span></span></p><p><span>3.</span><span><span>诚实守信，学风端正，不存在任何有违学术道德、专业伦理等行为；</span></span></p><p><span>4. </span><span><span>英语水平（满足以下至少其中一项）：</span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://cee.nankai.edu.cn/2026/0908/c37052a602087/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span>（</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>）通过全国大学英语六级考试（六级成绩</span></span><span>425</span><span><span>分及以上）或通过全国大学英语四级考试且成绩为优秀（四级成绩</span></span><span>550</span><span><span>分及以上）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span>2</span><span><span>）</span></span><span>TOEFL</span><span><span>成绩</span></span><span>90</span><span><span>分（</span></span><span>120</span><span><span>分制）及以上或</span></span><span>4.5</span><span><span>分（</span></span><span>6</span><span><span>分制）及以上；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span>3</span><span><span>）</span></span><span>IELTS</span><span><span>（</span></span><span>A</span><span><span>类</span></span><span>/</span><span><span>学术类）成绩</span></span><span>6</span><span><span>分及以上；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span>4</span><span><span>）</span></span><span>GRE</span><span><span>成绩在</span></span><span>310</span><span><span>以上，</span></span><span>GMAT</span><span><span>成绩在</span></span><span>640</span><span><span>以上；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>）英语专业四级（及以上）考试合格。</span></span></p><p><span>5</span><span><span>．教育部规定的其他条件要求。</span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span>二、招生类型及专业</span></strong></span></span></p><p><strong><span>1.</span></strong><span><span><strong><span>直接攻博（专业型），学制</span></strong></span></span><strong><span>5</span></strong><span><span><strong><span>年</span></strong></span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><strong><span>专业代码</span></strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><strong><span>专业名称</span></strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><strong><span>研究方向名称</span></strong></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>085400</span></p></td><td><p><span>电子信息</span></p></td><td><p><span>人工智能（自动化）</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>085400</span></p></td><td><p><span>电子信息</span></p></td><td><p><span>计算机技术（多模态基础模型构建）  </span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>086000</span></p></td><td><p><span>生物与医药</span></p></td><td><p><span>制药工程（天然小分子药物成药性结构优化）</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br/></p><p><strong><span>2.</span></strong><span><span><strong><span>专业学位硕士，学制</span></strong></span></span><strong><span>3</span></strong><span><span><strong><span>年</span></strong></span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><strong><span>专业代码</span></strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><strong><span>专业名称</span></strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><strong><span>研究方向名称</span></strong></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>085400</span></p></td><td><p><span>电子信息</span></p></td><td><p><span>光电信息（光电感知技术、光电测控）</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>085400</span></p></td><td><p><span>电子信息</span></p></td><td><p><span>计算机技术（基础软件与高算力系统）</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br/><br/></p><p><span><span><strong><span>三、申请方式及流程</span></strong></span></span></p><p><strong><span>1.</span></strong><span><span><strong><span>网上申请</span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>即日起至</span></span><strong><span>2026</span></strong><span><span><strong><span>年</span></strong></span></span><strong><span>9</span></strong><span><span><strong><span>月</span></strong></span></span><strong><span>9</span></strong><span><span><strong><span>日下午</span></strong></span></span><strong><span>16</span></strong><span><span><strong><span>点</span></strong><span>，登录“南开大学研究生报名系统” （</span></span></span><a href=\"https://yzxt.nankai.edu.cn/intern/frontend/web/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://yzxt.nankai.edu.cn/intern/frontend/web/</span></a><span><span><span>），选择</span><strong><span>“</span></strong></span></span><strong><span>25-</span></strong><span><span><strong><span>卓越工程师学院推免预报名项目（工程硕博士培养改革专项）”</span></strong><span>，填写申请信息。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>考生申请直博生项目，建议提前跟意向导师沟通，并需要两封专家推荐信，须亲笔签名，模版见“附件</span></span><span>1”</span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span>【重要提醒】请考生查看“招生类型及专业”，明确各研究方向招生类型，在系统中选报正确的项目以及研究方向、招生类型。</span></strong></span></span></p><p><strong><span>2. </span></strong><span><span><strong><span>提交电子版申请材料</span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>通过网上资格审查者（系统显示网审已通过），请于审查通过提交以下材料电子版：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>）《南开大学</span></span><span>2027</span><span><span>年推荐免试研究生申请信息表》</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>份（通过网审且生成报名号后，按照系统提示打印此表，需本人签字，报名号为</span></span><span>00000000</span><span><span>不影响提交）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span>2</span><span><span>）本科成绩单</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>份（需加盖学校教务部门公章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span>3</span><span><span>）专业排名证明</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>份（需加盖学校教务部门或院系公章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span>4</span><span><span>）个人陈述（模板见“附件</span></span><span>2”</span><span><span>）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>）英语成绩证明：大学英语六级成绩单或</span></span><span>TOEFL/GRE/</span><span><span>雅思成绩等证明文件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span>6</span><span><span>）（可选项）其他证明材料：包括获奖证书、代表性学术论文、出版物或其他原创性工作成果的复印件等。</span></span></p><p><span><span>以上材料须按次序扫描制成一个</span></span><span>PDF</span><span><span>文件，以“</span></span><span>01</span><span><span>校内面试</span></span><span>-</span><span><span>申请专业</span></span><span>-</span><span><span>就读学校</span></span><span>-</span><span><span>姓名”命名，请于</span></span><strong><span>2026</span></strong><span><span><strong><span>年</span></strong></span></span><strong><span>9</span></strong><span><span><strong><span>月</span></strong></span></span><strong><span>9</span></strong><span><span><strong><span>日下午</span></strong></span></span><strong><span>16</span></strong><span><span><strong><span>点前</span></strong><span>发送至</span></span></span><span>nkzhgxy@nankai.edu.cn</span><span><span><span>，</span><strong><span>邮件主题为“工程硕博士推免</span></strong></span></span><strong><span>+</span></strong><span><span><strong><span>申请专业</span></strong></span></span><strong><span>+</span></strong><span><span><strong><span>本科学校</span></strong></span></span><strong><span>+</span></strong><span><span><strong><span>姓名”</span></strong><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><strong><span>3.</span></strong><span><span><strong><span>面试选拔</span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>学院将组织专家组审核材料，入选考核名单、面试考核时间待各专业确定后另行通知。考核采取线下现场面试的方式，请申报同学提前预留时间，做好相关准备。</span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span>五、特别说明</span></strong></span></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span><span>获得推免资格的本科生，选择申请我院三年制硕士研究生（专业型）或五年制博士研究生（直接攻博）。如计划直接攻博，请提前与意向导师联系。</span></span></p><p><span>2.</span><span><span>请关注南开大学研究生招生网站通知（</span></span><span>http://yzb.nankai.edu.cn/</span><span><span>），以上内容如有变化，以最新通知为准。</span></span></p><p><span>3.</span><span><span>所有硕士推荐免试生及直博生必须通过中国研究生招生信息网进行申请，并在推免系统中完成全部流程，否则推荐免试无效。目前该系统尚未开通，请以教育部公布时间为准。</span></span></p><p><span>4.</span><span><span><span>申请直接攻博的同学，联系好申请导师后，</span><strong><span>将两封专家推荐函签字扫描版于考核前单独发送至学院邮箱</span></strong></span></span><strong><span>nkzhgxy@nankai.edu.cn</span></strong><span><span><strong><span>，邮件主题需注明“直博</span></strong></span></span><strong><span>+</span></strong><span><span><strong><span>申请专业</span></strong></span></span><strong><span>+</span></strong><span><span><strong><span>申请导师</span></strong></span></span><strong><span>+</span></strong><span><span><strong><span>本科学校</span></strong></span></span><strong><span>+</span></strong><span><span><strong><span>姓名”</span></strong><span>。专家推荐函（附件</span></span></span><span>1</span><span><span>）须分别由两位所申请专业领域内的教授或相当专业技术职称以上的专家推荐签字。推荐函纸质版请保存好，新生入学后需装入个人档案。</span></span></p><p><span>5.</span><span><span>招生各环节中，对申请人失信行为、学术不端行为等不良学风实行一票否决制。申请人必须保证提交的申请信息及全部申请材料的真实性和准确性。对弄虚作假、有违学术道德和专业伦理等不当行为，一经查实，不予录取或取消学习资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span>六、联系方式</span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>联系邮箱：</span></span><a href=\"mailto:nkzhgxy@nankai.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>nkzhgxy@nankai.edu.cn</span></a></p><p><span><span>联系电话：</span></span><span>022-22165755</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cee.nankai.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://cee.nankai.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/68/82/0d1a26b6484897c4dbe6ab3bd70b/95c2ec15-3026-4155-983d-09552d185da1.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1 2027年申请攻读南开大学博士学位研究生专家推荐函.doc</a></span></p><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cee.nankai.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://cee.nankai.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/68/82/0d1a26b6484897c4dbe6ab3bd70b/73e47709-2c35-47dc-bd27-0f4f3789e14a.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2 南开大学卓越工程师学院2027年接收推荐免试研究生个人陈述.doc</a></span></p><p><br/><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"12908816d03b371c787979032c699073718ba3343431234ba12052954cae714c","textLength":1990,"sourceSha256":"519c11b3d97e2c2813476e53c997f6c44a164816634ce41929857a4fff0c8a62","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-c7a493fa235a7c157ba4","title":"2026年南开大学卓越工程师学院2027年工程硕博士培养改革专项（全日制）接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生（含直博）若干方向开放预报名","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:05.177127+00:00"}
